{
  "title": "94: Ash-Sharh (Insherah) الشرح",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-merciful, the All-compassionate\nاَلَمْ نَشْرَحْ لَكَ صَدْرَكَۙ‏(1)\nALAM NASHRAH LAKA SADRAKA.\nHave We not expanded thee thy breast? \nوَوَضَعْنَا عَنْكَ وِزْرَكَۙ‏(2)\nWA WAZA’NAA A’NKA WIZRAKAL.\nAnd removed from thee thy burden \nالَّذِىْۤ اَنْقَضَ ظَهْرَكَۙ‏(3)\nLAZEE ANQAZA ZAHRAKA.\nThe which did gall thy back? \nوَرَفَعْنَا لَكَ ذِكْرَكَؕ‏(4)\nWA RA-FA’NAA LAKA ZIKRAK.\nAnd raised high the esteem (in which) thou (art held)? \nفَاِنَّ مَعَ الْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا ۙ‏(5)\nFA-INNA MA-A’L U’SRE YUSRAN.\nSo, verily, with every difficulty, there is relief: \nاِنَّ مَعَ الْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا ؕ‏(6)\nINNA MA-A’L U’SRE YUSRAA.\nVerily, with every difficulty there is relief. \nفَاِذَا فَرَغْتَ فَانْصَبْۙ‏(7)\nFA-EZAA FARAGHTA FAN-SAB.\nTherefore, when thou art free (from thine immediate task), still labour hard, \nوَاِلٰى رَبِّكَ فَارْغَب‏(8)\nWA ELAA RABBEKA FAR-GHAB.\nAnd to thy Lord turn (all) thy attention. ",
